  "scenario_id": "utility-feed-loss-2n",
  "title": "Utility feed loss under 2N power sources",
  "description": "The utility feed fails while a standby generator shares its supply path in a 2N configuration. The transfer switch carries the load on the remaining full-capacity path, so no service is interrupted. The downstream chain (ATS -> PDU -> service) is N-configured, so the power service is still not first-fault-tolerant overall \u2014 the scenario pins the distinction between an absorbed source fault and an unprotected distribution chain.",
